## Context
Preserve the dream/provenance changes originally at PR 1091 tip 6014c42f
without merging them as runtime-registration work. The other session owns
memory design. No real memory data is moved, reconciled or synchronized here.
The handoff branch is handoff-portable-memory, commit 5ff0a2e5; its changes
are unapproved. The other session can cherry-pick that commit or reuse the
patch; it contains only the five extracted helper/procedure/test files.
Do not merge that branch without resolving the findings below.

## Relevant files
skills/dream/SKILL.md, skills/dream/commit.py, skills/dream/provenance.py,
scripts/check-primary-checkout.sh, tests/test_dream.py.

## Findings to resolve
commit.py selects the resolved Git checkout but stages native
$HOME/.claude/projects/<project>/memory outside that repository: a separate
profile fixture exits 1 with "outside repository" after dream has edited
memory. The existing test uses the superseded profile-as-checkout layout.
read-index.py still reads native memory; merely staging checkout/projects
would commit stale data unless those edits are reconciled by an approved
versioning contract. Do not silently choose 0988's ownership option.
The provenance usage matcher misses .agents/memory and arbitrary root names.
Root isolation itself is verified by a red/green projected-script fixture.

## Test
Use independent native and checkout-owned stores in disposable HOME.
Exercise every provenance command through a projected script and explicit
root; assert the primary store is unchanged. Exercise dream's complete
read/edit/commit or fail-before-mutation contract, comparing note bytes.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Every provenance command accepts an explicit root and defaults to its own real checkout, never the primary alias.
- [ ] Dream's documented versioning contract works with independently owned runtime profiles, or rejects unsupported storage before any mutation; no ownership policy or data migration is implied.
- [ ] Read counts recognize the selected portable harness tier and retain native/project controls.
- [ ] Independent-profile commit and isolation regression tests pass with no lost or stale memory notes.
- [ ] Full make check passes; helper documentation accurately states supported storage and remaining limitations.

0934 store reconciliation and 0988 ownership/sync remain separate. No
Blocked-by dependency on the parent tracker or runtime child is asserted.
